cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Maize Planting Opportunity Units (MPOU)"
abstract: >-
  Maize Planting Opportunity Units (MPOU): zones land by how often daily weather let maize planted on a
  given day reach maturity, and by the typical season length. Works with any daily temperature and
  precipitation data.
